id: great-namekian-dragon-sized
name: Dragon-Sized
order: 3
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1
description: >
  You have grown to such proportions that you dwarf even the greatest of titans.
text: >
  Dragon-Sized: You have grown to such proportions that you dwarf even the greatest of titans.
  (1)-[Permanent]: You gain access to the 4th Grade of Great Namekian.
  (2)-[Passive]: The Growth Aspect for Great Namekian can reach up to 4 levels.
  (3)-[Passive]: Double the bonus from the 1st effect of Accelerated Growth.
  (4)-[Passive]: Increase the amount of Life Points you gain from the 6th effect of Namekian Biology by G(bT).

